Name Belgium Note - Liège Police-Prison #1

Interactability_Text_Line_0 The guards will do their routine checks at 8:00, 16:00 and 24:00 to ensure that all prisoners are in the right place. 
Interactability_Text_Line_1 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_2 Today is the only day to escape out of the grasp of law enforcement and the military; before we are taken in for experimentation by the Nulirane.
Interactability_Text_Line_3 ---
Interactability_Text_Line_4 -Oscar and Axel